{"id":"c39aca33de815fd4","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-formula-rank.md","title":"公式的逻辑符号秩","display":"df-formula-rank — 公式的逻辑符号秩","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-formula-rank","aliases":["18-df-formula-rank","18-df-034"],"display":"df-formula-rank — 公式的逻辑符号秩","depends_on":["[[18-df-formula]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"§4.5, before Theorem 4.5.2","source_pages":"65","source_pdf_pages":"75","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-formula-rank"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-formula-rank</span><span>18-df-034</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-formula-rank — 公式的逻辑符号秩"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.5, before Theorem 4.5.2"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"65"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"75"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a> 的有限公式构造树。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是原子公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,G\">\\(F,G\\)</span> 是公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 是相应语言的对象变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{rk}\">\\(\\mathrm{rk}\\)</span> 的值域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{rk}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\mathrm{rk}(\\neg F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{rk}(F)+1,\\\\\n\\mathrm{rk}(F\\circ G)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{rk}(F)+\\mathrm{rk}(G)+1,\\\\\n\\mathrm{rk}(\\forall x F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{rk}(F)+1,\\\\\n\\mathrm{rk}(\\exists x F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{rk}(F)+1.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{rk}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\mathrm{rk}(\\neg F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{rk}(F)+1,\\\\\n\\mathrm{rk}(F\\circ G)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{rk}(F)+\\mathrm{rk}(G)+1,\\\\\n\\mathrm{rk}(\\forall x F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{rk}(F)+1,\\\\\n\\mathrm{rk}(\\exists x F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{rk}(F)+1.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按原书印刷65页的 rnk(F) 计数逻辑符号数，故二元分支用和，修正旧稿的 max 深度。本节点的普通否定按逻辑构造计数；算术 Tait 把负文字作为原子，其专用秩在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7ddb1b71680edcd2\" href=\"?note=7ddb1b71680edcd2\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language\">18-df-arithmetic-tait-language</a> 内独立递归，从而不把负文字误计成逻辑否定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[18-df-formula]] 的有限公式构造树。$A$ 是原子公式，$F,G$ 是公式，$x$ 是相应语言的对象变量。$\\mathrm{rk}$ 的值域为 $\\omega$；$\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language","status":"resolved","id":"7ddb1b71680edcd2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"按原书印刷65页的 rnk(F) 计数逻辑符号数，故二元分支用和，修正旧稿的 max 深度。本节点的普通否定按逻辑构造计数；算术 Tait 把负文字作为原子，其专用秩在 [[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]] 内独立递归，从而不把负文字误计成逻辑否定。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"F,G","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{rk}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{rk}(A)&\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\mathrm{rk}(\\neg F)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{rk}(F)+1,\\\\\n\\mathrm{rk}(F\\circ G)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{rk}(F)+\\mathrm{rk}(G)+1,\\\\\n\\mathrm{rk}(\\forall x F)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{rk}(F)+1,\\\\\n\\mathrm{rk}(\\exists x F)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{rk}(F)+1.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1360,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-79","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-formula-rank]]"},{"id":"570d01ae273edcd2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal T=(N,\\prec,r,\\ell,c)$ 是 [[18-df-proof-tree]] 的证明树。$\\mathrm{rk}$ 为 [[18-df-formula-rank]] 的公式秩；$c(n)=\\ast$ 标记非切规则，$c(n)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 标记切公式。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-formula-rank]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-formula-rank]]"}],"outgoing":["2718a8a11c383b33","7ddb1b71680edcd2"]}